00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:27.900
<i>Almost a month had passed since Kagenui Yozuru
disappeared from North Shirahebi Shrine.</i>

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:32.900
<i>Of course, it's not my place to worry about Kagenui-san.</i>

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:37.260
<i>But I couldn't help visiting the shrine each day with a poor good grace.</i>

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:42.180
Come to think of it, "poor good grace" isn't a real phrase.

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:44.300
<i>This isn't good...</i>

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:47.790
<i>Today is my entrance exam, but I'm going to lose my confidence.</i>

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:54.340
<i>Well, in any case, Senjougahara was going to
escort me on the path to the college,</i>

00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:57.300
<i>so I have to head down the mountain
before the time we're to meet.</i>

