00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:10.570
<i>Your scores are already above the passing mark.</i>

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:14.390
So, as long as you avoid any situations
where you're unable to take the exam,

00:01:14.390 --> 00:01:16.700
your campus life is in sight.

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:18.870
<i>It's been one month.</i>

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:22.450
<i>Nothing around, nothing happened, and time was passing by.</i>

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:28.480
<i>No apparitions, no urban legends,
no secondhand information, no idle rumors.</i>

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:31.860
<i>Of course, there weren't any school ghost stories, either.</i>

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:34.960
<i>It's as if everything was over.</i>

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:36.850
Gaen-san.

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:40.200
Hey, Koyomin.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.140
Morning.

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:43.890
Good morning.

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:48.280
It seems like you're in big trouble,
your body, that is, Koyomin.

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:51.700
No, it's not that much trouble.

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:53.400
Right.

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.780
If I had to pick, the one in big trouble...

00:01:55.780 --> 00:01:57.170
is Yozuru.

00:01:58.170 --> 00:02:00.660
To think that they would go after her.

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:03.660
Well, it was unexpected, even for me.

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:06.050
It couldn't have been unexpected, right?

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:08.790
You know everything, don't you?

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:13.090
Come now, are you being sarcastic to a friend
you haven't seen in a while, Koyomin?

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:27.410
Kagenui was eliminated simply because she was in the way.

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:29.640
Not Kagenui Yozuru herself,

00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:32.290
but her shikigami Ononoki Yotsugi.

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:35.410
So, to disable and nullify her,

00:02:35.410 --> 00:02:38.110
they took care of her master.

00:02:39.210 --> 00:02:42.430
Without the master, who's at the top of the chain of command,

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:48.410
that little girl with a posed look is nothing to be scared of.

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:52.560
Koyomin, the reason why Yotsugi was sent to your house

00:02:52.830 --> 00:02:57.710
is because a genuinely artificial apparition
like her could've protected you,

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:00.540
but it seems someone didn't approve of that.

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:04.640
This someone couldn't lay a hand on Yotsugi,

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:06.820
because she was a genuine apparition.

00:03:06.820 --> 00:03:09.730
That's why she went after her master, you know?

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:14.230
The story that branches out from here
is roughly separated into two paths.

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:16.780
One where Yotsugi becomes powerless as they wanted,

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:19.970
and becomes an ineffective bodyguard
who simply stands at your side.

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:21.240
<b>MARCH 13TH</b>

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:23.310
The other where, surprisingly,
Yotsugi's human nature awakens,

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:26.620
and she tries to protect your
intangible recklessness of her own will,

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:28.930
losing sight of her duties as an apparition.

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:35.390
I don't need to explain what happens
when an apparition loses sight of her duties, do I?

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:38.750
Because you've seen for yourself what happens.

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:42.650
In the situation where Ononoki Yotsugi's no longer a genuine apparition,

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:47.890
she can no longer meddle, and is nothing for them to fear.

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:50.520
<i>What in the world is the point of taking things so far?</i>

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:53.640
<i>It's almost as if they want to prevent me from doing something.</i>

00:03:53.990 --> 00:03:56.730
<i>Or is it that they want me to do something?</i>

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:58.400
Shinobu-chan is...

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:02.230
sound asleep now, I take it, Koyomin?

00:04:02.230 --> 00:04:03.120
Yes.

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:05.210
Recently, she's become completely nocturnal.

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:07.760
She's usually asleep at this hour.

00:04:08.780 --> 00:04:12.730
Well, that's probably her having
her own idea of things, so to say.

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:18.500
She's getting her life close to the true nature
of an apparition, in case of an emergency.

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:19.500
Of course,

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:23.130
her doing so when she's already
becoming less of an apparition

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:24.760
is pretty pointless.

00:04:25.310 --> 00:04:28.670
Well, for the not so perfect immortal and vampire,

00:04:28.670 --> 00:04:31.520
the current Kiss-shot Acerola-orion Heart-under-blade,

00:04:32.270 --> 00:04:36.970
it'd be impossible to guard you 24 hours a day in any case.

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:40.020
It's difficult to prevent an assassination.

00:04:40.390 --> 00:04:46.280
For comparison, it's as reckless as trying to win
a game of shogi without losing any pieces.

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:51.870
Sacrificial pieces arise even for the most proud,
compassionate commander, no matter what they do.

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:56.870
Is this the story about how you lose the king while trying to save a pawn?

00:04:57.310 --> 00:05:01.630
A rook, a bishop, even gold and silver generals can be sacrificed at any time.

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:04.880
The only piece that can never be sacrificed is the king.

00:05:05.220 --> 00:05:07.980
Come to think of it, shogi is such a strange game.

00:05:08.430 --> 00:05:11.510
Even if you lose every piece other than the king,

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:15.410
if the king remains alive, you can use it to win.

00:05:16.390 --> 00:05:17.880
Now, Koyomin.

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:20.120
Do you think you're the king?

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:22.400
No, of course not.

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:23.660
Right.

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:25.730
You're a modest one, as you are.

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:28.280
In this town right now, a king...

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:30.600
doesn't exist.

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:33.970
The position of king is open in this town.

00:05:34.550 --> 00:05:36.910
That's why all sorts of shortcomings are happening.

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:40.290
In other words, it's like playing shogi
with all the pieces except the king.

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:44.860
I've heard of playing shogi without a rook or a bishop as a handicap,

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:47.840
but playing shogi without the king is unheard of.

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:51.560
In that case, how do you determine who wins and loses?

00:05:51.970 --> 00:05:55.470
In that case, there's no win or loss, probably.

00:05:55.470 --> 00:05:58.980
Because you're lacking the conditions
for both victory and defeat.

00:05:58.980 --> 00:05:59.950
Right.

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:01.860
A condition where there's no win or loss.

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:04.130
People call that being outside the law.

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:05.980
<i>An empty seat.</i>

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:11.320
<i>The one who mentioned there was an emptiness before chaos was Kaiki, I believe?</i>

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:16.200
Oshino tried to stabilize this town spiritually
while leaving the empty seat as is,

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:18.710
while I tried to fill the seat of king, if only as a formality.

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:22.840
I entrusted that to you, Koyomin, and you failed to do so.

00:06:23.370 --> 00:06:25.590
That's what's happened so far, right?

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:31.610
I thought leaving Yotsugi at your side
would keep them in check,

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:33.960
but it doesn't look like that went as hoped.

00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:36.820
Kagenui has gone missing,

00:06:36.820 --> 00:06:38.800
and Kaiki has disappeared.

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:41.140
And I don't know Oshino's whereabouts.

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:43.660
The situation is getting rather dire.

00:06:44.510 --> 00:06:46.980
I had to start making moves myself.

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:48.990
By making moves, what do you...

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:54.240
It means I want to contain this situation
where the damage keeps increasing, Koyomin.

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:58.840
So, maybe I should say "stopping moves"
rather than "making moves" in this case.

00:06:58.840 --> 00:07:01.120
Especially your moves, Koyomin.

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:02.220
Mine?

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:04.890
No, I don't intend to make any moves.

00:07:04.890 --> 00:07:06.380
Nothing of the sort.

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:11.440
Isn't that why Kagenui-san put Ononoki-chan in my care?

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:15.690
But Yotsugi can't accomplish that job, either.

00:07:15.690 --> 00:07:19.840
She can't protect you, nor can she stop you.

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:21.190
She's literally a puppet.

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:22.440
P

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:22.440
U

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:22.440
P

