00:07:22.440 --> 00:07:24.310
That's why you're able to make a move.

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:27.840
You can make a move now,
and there's no one to stop you.

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:29.470
And to make things difficult,

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:31.070
when you move,

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:32.570
"that side" moves, too.

00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:33.670
"That side"?

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:36.620
You don't have to think about
where "that side" is, though.

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:37.580
In other words,

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:38.830
it's "that person."

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:42.590
The problem is that it's dangerous for you to make a move.

00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:46.130
Or rather, that side's waiting for you to do so.

00:07:46.130 --> 00:07:49.640
So, the situation is like a duel where the first one to make a move loses.

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:51.340
It feels like a dilemma.

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:52.750
A dilemma?

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:54.220
Of what and what?

00:07:54.690 --> 00:07:57.530
I can see what the solution is,

00:07:57.530 --> 00:08:01.240
but it hurts my heart to actually execute it.

00:08:01.240 --> 00:08:02.750
<i>Solution?</i>

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:05.000
<i>Solution for what?</i>

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:11.070
It's the solution to clear the darkness
that has long enveloped this city.

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:14.530
And that solution is...

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:15.950
for you to die.

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:17.990
It's all right.

00:08:17.990 --> 00:08:19.720
It will only hurt for a second.

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:39.530
<b>THE SWORD WAS SIMILAR TO ONE I WAS FAMILIAR WITH.</b>

00:08:39.530 --> 00:08:41.030
<b>THE BLADE SHE WIELDED — WAS THE REAL THING.</b>

00:08:41.030 --> 00:08:42.540
<b>THE ORIGINAL APPARITION KILLER — SUPPOSEDLY ERADICATED IN THE PAST.</b>

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:47.070
It's a shame it had to end this way.

00:08:48.610 --> 00:08:50.800
<i>It was just like Senjougahara said.</i>

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:53.670
<i>For a guy like me,</i>

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:57.760
<i>getting to the test center was the biggest obstacle to overcome,</i>

00:08:57.760 --> 00:08:59.330
<i>more than the test itself.</i>

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:03.090
<i>And it looks like I've failed in that respect.</i>

